sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: MPP charge with the card method (Visa-authored, encrypted network token)
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: MPP charge with the card method (Visa-authored, encrypted network token). 5 participants: Client (agent), Client Enabler, Merchant server, Server Enabler (PSP or acquirer), and Card network. 7 steps, 7 crossing a trust boundary, 1 failure branch. Based on stripe-mpp draft-card-charge-00 (undated, repository text of 2026-04-16, unchanged at commit 50309c8) (2026-04-16). Step 1: Merchant server to Client (agent): 402 with method= card. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Client (agent) to Client Enabler: Ask for a token for this challenge. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Client Enabler to Client (agent): Encrypted payload. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Client (agent) to Merchant server: Retry with Authorization: Payment. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Merchant server to Server Enabler (PSP or acquirer): Forward encryptedPayload. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 6: Server Enabler (PSP or acquirer) to Card network: Authorize. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Decline: Server should issue a fresh 402. Step 7: Merchant server to Client (agent): 200 with Payment-Receipt. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_client as Client (agent)
  participant p_ce as Client Enabler
  participant p_server as Merchant server
  participant p_se as Server Enabler (PSP or acquirer)
  participant p_net as Card network
  p_server-->>p_client: 402 with method=#quot;card#quot;
  Note over p_server,p_client: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_client->>p_ce: Ask for a token for this challenge
  Note over p_client,p_ce: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_ce-->>p_client: Encrypted payload
  Note over p_ce,p_client: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_client->>p_server: Retry with Authorization: Payment
  Note over p_client,p_server: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_server->>p_se: Forward encryptedPayload
  Note over p_server,p_se: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_se->>p_net: Authorize
    Note over p_se,p_net: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Decline
    Note over p_se,p_net: Server should issue a fresh 402.
  end
  p_server-->>p_client: 200 with Payment-Receipt
  Note over p_server,p_client: Crosses a trust boundary
